            "action_name": {
              "value": "Red Ruin Stance"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(stance)\n\nRequirements: Murschen is unarmored\n\nMurschen takes the stance of the red ruin, designed to tear away chunks of flesh like a ferocious beast. Murschen can make red claw unarmed attacks. These attacks deal 1d10 slashing damage; are in the brawling; and have the finesse, sweep, and unarmed traits. While in this stance, when Murschen would reduce his frightened condition value by 1, he reduces it to 0."
